// i inner, constants T = ci 1 and V = ci 1 (both operands matrices), X = ci 1 (k = 3: the chain loop
// runs z = 1, 2), the indices a[i,z] = i + z*2, b[z,v] = z + v*3, R[i,v] = i + v*2; the result is the
// fixed-size f64[2,2]. Code at lines 1-4. Output: [22 28; 49 64].
